{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1beda3eb43b9cf209ae2ef8c02643f0c3a883fbcc789c3f8884fe5fb10098af", "ja": "（もうすぐ、次の定期公演の準備が始まる。\n今回、センターを任せたいのは……あ、いたいた）", "zh": "（下一场定期公演的准备马上就要开始了。\n这次想让谁担任中心位呢……啊，找到了找到了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "f8bb977d0e08a554a48501dc8a5b7ea5874b9e425023a688cdcd2580aa5aea56", "ja": "あら、{$P$}さん。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "930e91e617349161d2b4e8bdf54b7fb32378b60b9cc13dcaef7b13b609793c4d", "ja": "お疲れさまです、あずささん。\nみんなもお疲れさま。", "zh": "辛苦了，梓小姐。\n大家也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "54f9978e401a164efd9822d4e644f37120d359ab3e575442d8050f338a94ac00", "ja": "{$P$}さん、なんだか難しい顔を\nされていますけど……どうかしましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您好像一脸凝重……是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b147f7eca32f025a03178577ff742f81c34c9c01952543ab74addd18cbe84720", "ja": "今日のグラビア撮影だったら、心配ないと思いますよ？\nスタッフさん達も、とってもほめてくれましたし……。", "zh": "如果是今天的写真拍摄，我觉得不用担心吧？  \n工作人员们也都夸我们了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "3e7576b12dbcdaa8ab09ef8042642e7742615e9467e3cb94acfec07ac295479c", "ja": "ええ、そうね！　私たちの水着姿、\n{$P$}にも見せたかったわ。ウフフ♪", "zh": "是啊！也想让{$P$}看看我们的泳装模样呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "942d64e66d55297ff38f0dcc4a6c93e54033f5a911a84acfa36d47dfe1f146cd", "ja": "そうですか、それは良かった。\nみんなの水着姿、見たかったですね。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。真想看看大家穿泳装的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3af97f65eae66ca2ebaa07474ad63dd1af237b13b478710d86052e308887ab5e", "ja": "も、もう。{$P$}さんったら、\nそんなこと堂々と言わなくても……。", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生也真是的，\n用不着这么堂而皇之地说出来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "51e4a3a6e2c3c32a31d31437e78c4566cd1fc79601409e3827be80a12a287319", "ja": "あら、風花ちゃんだって見てもらいたかったでしょ？\nギャラリーがいなくちゃ、張り合いがないじゃない♪", "zh": "哎呀，风花你不也想让人看看吗？没有观众的话，也提不起劲来嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c2e5b1e8e9675c07f414a076d6b6e5645a6e7e64729923b494142e8d9da53aa6", "ja": "そ、そうかもしれませんけど……。でもやっぱり、\n水着姿を近くで見られるのは、恥ずかしいですよ～！", "zh": "可、可能是这样没错……但是，被人近距离看到穿泳装的样子，果然还是很害羞啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "84ebb0a8bf1c43d58f3d56476e864e1cbd821626b02c46b4277f9311649fbc8d", "ja": "あずささんは、どうでしたか？\n何か困った事はありませんでしたか。", "zh": "秋月小姐，感觉怎么样？\n有没有遇到什么麻烦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "9b1e62301abd34b51aec53dbfaa1c519516765ee6200a592a7d01b3a6bc9692e", "ja": "大丈夫です～、とっても楽しかったですよ？\nこのみちゃんと風花ちゃんも一緒でしたし……。", "zh": "没问题的～，非常开心哦？\n而且这回还有木实和风花陪着我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "ad8179abcb9b2e761655ffe1bc1d60d36c495eb10effb41fc411c721ceba93a5", "ja": "それに今日は、朝の星座占いでも、\n最高の仕事運って出ていましたから♪", "zh": "而且今天早上的电视星座占卜还说，工作运是最棒的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ef675144f2e2acfbb4d51bb94f46a5e94e02df94a4ae26153f2cc9a666edefd2", "ja": "あ、テレビの星占いですか。\nそういえばあずささん、占いが好きですもんね。", "zh": "啊，是电视上的星座占卜啊。说起来，梓小姐确实很喜欢占卜呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "693f8ce72a3434cb1d0823838ed55eb777f53778cec856fb5b607c212df2ddec", "ja": "ふふっ、女の子はみんな、\n占いが好きだと思いますよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，我觉得女孩子都喜欢占卜呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "bbde8d757f912615b8a0d6171486013e54bb673b0126e40d49a79698bb3b4574", "ja": "私も占いは気になるタチなのよね。……そうだわ、\nちょっとあずさちゃんに占ってもらおうかしら？", "zh": "我也是属于会在意占卜的那种人呢。……对了，要不要请梓帮我占卜一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e32c426fa9f274574a0dce5f0e4e36831d520a230405e087819d62bd62d69545", "ja": "このみさん、ちょっと待ってくださいね。\n実は、あずささんに相談があって来たんです。", "zh": "风花小姐，请稍等一下。\n其实我是有件事想找梓小姐商量，所以才过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "657fcbed2e8216e744d0ec7c1c78f924d7a412bc5ad791b35321114a6394d24f", "ja": "まあ、やっぱり……わかりました、私でよければ。\nそれで、仕事運ですか？　もしかして恋愛運とか……？", "zh": "嗯，果然是这样……我明白了，如果你不嫌弃我的话。\n那么，是想问工作运吗？还是说，可能是恋爱运之类的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2f913587f535c7f67230028ca89a83fe4fc75ccbeee37b26a41c44353ad2d231", "ja": "いえ、俺の人生は置いておいて……。あずささん、\n今度の定期公演で、センターをお願いします！", "zh": "不，我的人生先放在一边……梓小姐，\n下次的定期公演，想请您担任C位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "a669226ad436b4102e95cf556dcb7ff8b9eabe161ebb338cb1eab5fa276c6715", "ja": "今度の定期公演で、センター……。まあ！\nあの、つまり、私のセンター公演っていうことですか？", "zh": "这次的定期公演，让我站C位……哎呀！\n那个，也就是说，这是我的C位公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fffd841d3aabf14cf0e1bf748531a0256711c14fa766cdbb151c3695d19deade", "ja": "はい、そういうことです！", "zh": "是的，就是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "13f84984beb16bdf561b9176115ff0e9f65bfcba71c8bb8f7fd42f7acc54c808", "ja": "わぁ……ついにあずささんのセンター公演なんですね！\n私、ずっと楽しみにしてたんです！", "zh": "哇……终于要迎来梓小姐担任C位的演出了呢！\n我一直都好期待这一天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "33712ca08acecdc5a060c6bd3d18bc2c3edd8c1bb2c0d2c29ee4af765afbc916", "ja": "やったわね、あずさちゃん！　私にも応援させて\nちょうだい。一緒のステージに立ちたいわ！", "zh": "太棒了，梓！也让我来为你加油\n吧。我也想和你站上同一个舞台呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7528827fb3711b1f2cff05c52eb9b2f45478ef44a1d80b6cb6f7ea4d3bee041b", "ja": "あ、わ、私も！\nよかったら、お手伝いさせてください！", "zh": "啊，我、我也想！\n如果你不介意的话，请让我也来帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "b56d45e6d150cbca61bd257ed0fd47612f560131e4f6c865bb99c37b58269f94", "ja": "このみちゃん、風花ちゃん……ありがとう。\nその気持ち、とってもうれしいわ。", "zh": "木实、小风花……谢谢你们。\n你们的这份心意，让我非常开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3b1fb4403488ae1fbdfa03aad63cdba9aec3ba2720dd581637fc6261f4e74cdc", "ja": "あずささん……\nという事は、引き受けてもらえますか？", "zh": "秋月小姐……\n也就是说，您愿意接下这个任务吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "2be6dae703c1bed4e3aa20c6f8d13fc645f2e57e714cea950807e11579fbe5fc", "ja": "はい。突然で、ちょっと驚きましたけど……\n私でよろしければ、引き受けさせていただきます。", "zh": "好的。虽然事情来得突然，让我有点惊讶……  \n如果您不嫌弃的话，就请让我来负责吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1027_p", "source_sha256": "888b8aa65b22e4ed8c786c6c31e81181651f454a56457d746cbe57172904f145", "ja": "よかった、よろしくお願いします！\nそれじゃ早速ですけど……", "zh": "太好了，那就拜托你了！\n那么事不宜迟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1028_p", "source_sha256": "cef6bd0aab7b9f79653ce9398af1b26d7e43a28f1f683439302562b67ed60958", "ja": "センターとしてどんな公演にするか、どんな曲が\nいいか。今のうちに考えておいてくださいね。", "zh": "作为C位，要办成什么样的公演、选什么样的歌曲，现在就请先考虑一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "5b30b960c691e006b02d3bdcb5ea5c3bb6a770ad8d1f390758473444fb515944", "ja": "あっ……どんな公演に……ですか？　えっと～……。", "zh": "啊……要办成什么样的公演……吗？那个～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3040d2bbfa645de5daf42606b9fc23f1b2a78a752b922ac5a2c3d0f47e439b9", "ja": "このメンバー的には、もう決まったも同然よね～。\nウフフ♪", "zh": "从这组成员来看，基本上已经等于决定了吧～  \n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4135f79f8191a2901aaac4873468d63d54804c8d1843cbe52783e8aa369dd794", "ja": "えっ？　あっ……。\nえっと、大人、っていうこと……ですか？", "zh": "咦？啊……  \n那个，您的意思是……要成熟一些吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "5402ad86628f1fefae622afcc3b092ab5dc5cbb509549d271d97ea8e34175639", "ja": "どんな公演にして、どんな曲……。\nう～ん……。", "zh": "要办成什么样的演出，要选什么样的歌曲……\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_053_1033_p", "source_sha256": "c21518ba2baf0fe218627f235c30cd177be5dc461f724de207bdf8274e219079", "ja": "（あずささん、もう少し迷いそうだな。\nまあ、おいおい決めてもらうことにしよう！）", "zh": "（梓小姐看来还要再犹豫一阵子。\n算了，之后再慢慢决定吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
